  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Ad-Me Algorithm\r\n\r\nPlan how your video streaming platform decides **what ads to show viewers**. \r\n\r\nChoose **two questions** that will lead to **four different ad experiences**. Fill in the flowchart and test cases table based on your plan.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Define the **inputs** (states or controls) that drive each **decision** (diamond).\r\n\r\n2. Fill in all **three decision points** with a question and all **four outcomes**, where each outcome states **which ad will be shown**.\r\n\r\n3. Fill in the **Test Cases table** with one row for each path, showing how the different inputs lead to each outcome.\r\n\r\n4. Save your **flowchart to your Backpack** and add it to your files in the next level.",
    "display_name": "Ad-Me Algorithm",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Design how your app personalizes what users see.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/8ffd472ae8ab981c61fd3c9e87b6c251-Icon Template (10).png",
